exports[`bookend oracle — hi > 9 · slash /hi weekday → day-job greeting (location line, header, seeded actions) + nav bar 1`] = `
[
  {
    "arg": {
      "components": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "content": "📍 🛡️ **The Warden's Oak** — Use \`look\` for the full scene.

⚔️  **Aldric** — Warrior",
              "type": 10,
            },
            {
              "type": 14,
            },
            {
              "content": "❤️ 10/10  ┃  ⚡ 10/10  ┃  🎲 3  ┃  💰 5",
              "type": 10,
            },
            {
              "type": 14,
            },
            {
              "content": "🛡️ **Town Guard — Town Square — Daily Work**

  🎯 **Drill with the watch** — You put your back into the training yard until your arms burn. Steady hands keep the watch alive.
  🔧 **Inspect the lockup** — You check the cells. One door's hinge has been worked loose — from the inside.
  📋 **Stand the gate** — You hold the gate, marking who comes and goes. A few faces you don't know, and one you wish you didn't.

📦 Press the **Action** button or type \`action <what you do>\` to start.",
              "type": 10,
            },
          ],
          "type": 17,
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "custom_id": "nav:journal",
