🧬 Race
⚖️ Alignment
🔧 Day Job
🎒 Starting Kit

__**Upbringing**__
🎖️ **Soldier**
> 💪+1 📖-1
Raised in a military family. Discipline was your first language. The scars are your father's.

⚖️ **Merchant**
> 💪-1 📖+1 💬+1
Grew up behind a counter. You could read a ledger before you could read a story.

📚 **Scholar**
> 💪-1 📖+2 💬-1
Books over breakfast. Your parents taught you the old tongues — some of them true.

🌟 **Folk Hero**
> 💬+1
Common blood, uncommon courage. Your village still tells stories about the fire you pulled them from.

🏚️ **Outcast**
> 🧠+1 💬-1
You grew up on the edge of things. The forest taught you what people wouldn't.

👑 **Noble**
> 💪-1 🧠-1 📖+1 💬+2
Manor-born. You learned poise, politics, and how to make a room listen.

🪚 **Artisan**
> 💪+1 🧠+1 📖-1 💬-1
Your hands know wood, stone, or metal before your mind knows letters.

🌾 **Farmstead**
> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-1
You read weather, soil, and seasons like others read books.

⛪ **Temple-Raised**
> 🧠+2 📖-1 💬-1
Given to the old faith as a child. The hymns are still in your bones.

🗝️ **Urchin**
> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-2
The gutter taught you everything. Pockets, roofs, escape routes.

🎭 **Entertainer**
> 💪-1 📖-1 💬+2
You travelled with a troupe. You learned to read a room before you learned to read a page.

🧭 **Scout**
> 💪+1 🧠+2 💬-2
Range-born. Your family kept the borders, watched the roads, knew when something changed.",
          "footer": {
            "icon_url": undefined,
            "text": "Step 3 of 7 — Upbringing",
          },
          "thumbnail": {
            "url": "attachment://theoak.png",
          },
