🎒 Starting Kit

__**Race**__
🧑 **Human**
> 💬+1
The most common folk. Adaptable, ambitious, everywhere.

🪓 **Dwarf**
> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-2
Stone and steel. Stocky, stubborn, unshakeable.

🧝 **Elf**
> 💪-1 🧠+1 📖+1
Grace and age. You've seen centuries. The Oak was a sapling when you were young.

🍀 **Halfling**
> 💪-2 💬+2
Small and lucky. The world is big — you've learned to slip through the cracks.

🌗 **Half-Elf**
> 💪-1 🧠+1 📖+1
Two bloodlines, one heart. You walk between worlds — welcome in neither, at home in both.

💪 **Half-Orc**
> 💪+2 🧠-1 💬-1
Two bloods, one fist. You carry the strength of one world and the rejection of both.

🏔️ **Dúnedain**
> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-1
Blood of the West. Your people have guarded the borders for so long the villages forgot you exist.",
