⚖️ **Alignment** ◀
🔧 Day Job
🎒 Starting Kit

__**Alignment**__
😇 **Lawful Good**
Order and compassion. The code is the shield.

🕊️ **Neutral Good**
Kindness above all. Rules are tools, not masters.

🔥 **Chaotic Good**
Freedom and mercy. Break the law to save the innocent.

📏 **Lawful Neutral**
Order is its own virtue. The code, always.

⚖️ **True Neutral**
Balance. You walk the middle road.

🎲 **Chaotic Neutral**
Impulse and instinct. No master, no chain.

🗡️ **Lawful Evil**
Cruelty within the rules. The system serves you.

🐍 **Neutral Evil**
Selfishness without restraint. You take what you want.

💀 **Chaotic Evil**
Destruction for its own sake. The world burns.",
          "footer": {
            "icon_url": undefined,
            "text": "Step 5 of 7 — Alignment",
          },
          "thumbnail": {
            "url": "attachment://theoak.png",
          },
          "title": "⚔️  Forge Your Hero",
        },
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "_attachment": "theoak.png",
        },
      ],
    },
    "method": "editReply",
  },
]
`;

