🔧 **Day Job** ◀
🎒 Starting Kit

__**Day Job**__
🛡️ **Town Guard**
Patrol the walls. Break up tavern brawls. The town sleeps safer.

🔨 **Blacksmith**
Hammer and anvil. Every town needs one. Every blade remembers your name.

🏹 **Hunter**
Track game in the eastern woods. The Oak's larder depends on you.

📜 **Scribe**
Copy manuscripts. Translate old tongues. The warden's library is yours.

🌿 **Herbalist**
Gather roots and remedies. The sick come to you before the priest.

🎶 **Minstrel**
Play the taverns. Carry news between towns. Every song is a secret.

💰 **Merchant**
Buy low in Stonebridge, sell high at the Oak. Coin before creed.

🕯️ **Acolyte**
Tend the shrine. Bless the harvest. The people need someone to believe in.

🚶 **Wanderer**
No roof, no boss, no routine. You sleep under the Oak and eat what luck brings.",
